📄 PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)
Product Name (Working Title)

StarConnect
(A premium celebrity booking & contact landing platform)

1️⃣ PRODUCT OVERVIEW
Vision

Create a cinematic, premium, light-themed landing web application that allows users globally to request meetings, collaborations, or event invitations with celebrities (actors, influencers, public figures).

The platform will function as:

A high-end brand presentation site

A curated celebrity showcase

A contact request portal

A minimal analytics-driven admin dashboard

This is NOT a marketplace.
This is a premium gateway experience.

2️⃣ TARGET AUDIENCE
Primary Users

Event organizers

Brand managers

Corporate agencies

Media production houses

High-net-worth individuals

Secondary Users

PR teams

Talent agencies

Marketing agencies

3️⃣ CORE FEATURES (LANDING PAGE ONLY)
🎬 3.1 Cinematic Hero Section
Objective:

Deliver a visually stunning first impression.

Requirements:

Full-width cinematic video background OR subtle animated gradient

Smooth fade-in headline animation

Headline example:

“Connect With Global Icons”

Subheadline:

“Book. Meet. Collaborate.”

CTA Buttons:

“Explore Stars”

“Request a Meeting”

Animation:

Smooth scroll reveal

Elegant fade transitions

Light-based premium aesthetics (white + gold + subtle shadow depth)

🌟 3.2 Star Carousel Section
Objective:

Showcase celebrities dynamically from database.

Requirements:

Horizontal cinematic carousel

Each card includes:

Image (from database)

Name

Category (Actor / Influencer / Speaker)

Country

Short bio

“Request Booking” button

Design:

Premium card style

Soft shadows

Light theme (white background)

Gold/neutral accents

Smooth carousel transitions

Behavior:

Images loaded dynamically from database

Lazy loading enabled

Modal view on click with:

Larger image

Full biography

Tags

Availability status

Contact CTA

📝 3.3 Booking / Contact Request Form
Objective:

Allow users to submit meeting requests.

Fields:

Full Name

Company Name

Email

Phone Number

Country

Star Selected (dropdown)

Event Type

Proposed Date

Message

Features:

Form validation

Anti-spam protection

Success animation after submission

Email notification to admin

Store submission in database

🌍 3.4 Global Access Section

Simple section explaining:

Global representation

Secure communication

Verified talent network

Discretion & professionalism

With premium icon animations.

